  # quantal thr-, not reuptake clearance energy+, not refill VGLUT pack, not dock
  # HOPS tethering, not arm NSF priming, not clamp complexin clamp, not trigger Ca
  # fusion, not pore SNARE zipper, not mix content dump, not collapse coat uncoat,
