  # gating, not cleave pcr+ SPC signal-peptide scission).
  # HEAT += take (each OST en-bloc glycan transfer / dolichol cycle step dissipates
  #   as glycosyltransferase work).
  # ENERGY -= take (glycosyl burns active metabolic pool into N-glycan transfer;
  #   kin to cleave energy- but raises QC threshold competence instead of pcr bank).
  # ATP -= take (OST STT3 catalytic cycle / dolichol-linked donor presentation).
  # THRESHOLD rises: thr = min(1000, thr + take) — N-glycan marks commit cargo into
  #   calnexin/calreticulin QC competence gate (distinct from synapse thr+ contact,
  #   condense thr+ pack, mature thr+ LE identity, activate thr- zymogen arming).
  # AGE/RESERVE/SETPOINT/PMF/PCR HELD — glycosyl is post-cleave glycan transfer after
  #   SPC freed the luminal N-terminus, not anabolic age repair, not free-AA reserve
  #   spend, not secretory sp bank (transloc), not EE proton bank, not phosphagen pcr
  #   (cleave fragments).
  # Ready recomputed from energy vs threshold after energy spend (quiescent forces 0).
  # Continuum: ...->export->translate->transloc->cleave->glycosyl->trim->cnx.
  # Signature: heat+n energy-n atp-n thr+n; age+reserve+sp+pmf+pcr held — glycosyl life-force.
  # Usability: AGI models post-cleave OST N-glycosylation under ASSERT.
  # Returns take glycosylated; dead/n<1/empty atp|energy -> 0.
END
